{"id":"layz6qir7f8y3phk7qvi71we0","title":"pwn.ai 披露 CVE-2026-99999：Linux 网络栈漏洞导致 KVM 虚拟机逃逸","originalTitle":"PwnEscape: Guest-to-Host KVM Escape (CVE-2026-99999)","summary":"pwn.ai 团队通过 Vercel 的百万美元沙箱挑战，发现 Linux 网络栈中校验和元数据在延迟处理时可篡改 IPv4 头，进而实现宿主机内存读取与代码执行。该漏洞被分配为 CVE-2026-99999，上游 Linux 内核已通过提交 6785011f8b16 修复，通过在五个关键位置添加校验和起始地址验证来阻断攻击路径。","reason":"文章提供了从虚拟机逃逸到宿主机代码执行的完整证据链，并给出了内核修复方案与审计思路，供安全研究者参考。","source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://pwn.ai/blog/pwnescape"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-17T18:24:39.593Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-17T18:47:36.601Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-17T18:47:36.601Z","category":"security-privacy","tags":["安全漏洞","Linux","Microsoft","Google"],"score":91,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"66e85041-63e1-4691-a51a-2775d6862a59","title":"Linux KVM逃逸漏洞CVE-2026-99999已获修复"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"66e85041-63e1-4691-a51a-2775d6862a59","title":"Linux KVM逃逸漏洞CVE-2026-99999已获修复"}],"topics":[{"slug":"linux","name":"Linux"},{"slug":"supply-chain-security","name":"供应链与依赖安全"},{"slug":"security-fix","name":"安全修复与漏洞"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"ftKyEpfGqUGk","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}